 Large 800
 XL 850</b>

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:55.090
Ramen after practice tastes extra good.

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:57.830
Shouldn't you be eating at home?

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.410
It's fine. I let them know.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.120
They did sound jealous, though. 
They said it wasn't fair.

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:06.650
If you're trying to convince me 
to change my mind, I already—

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.410
I'm not giving up the singles spot.

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:13.480
I might've disrupted the team by joining.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.350
I know it's an important time 
with the tournament coming up.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:20.590
But I made that choice prepared 
for everything it would entail.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:24.630
I know I can't compete with you.

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:27.150
The coach made the right decision.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:31.600
You're always capable of calmly seeing 
things from a bird's-eye view.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:35.950
You're an honest worker. As your 
superior, I have no complaints.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:40.940
But don't you think you're being
 inconsiderate of your own feelings?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:48.530
As your teammate, I don't want 
you to give up like I did once.

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:53.130
Of course, I don't regret choosing my family.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:58.640
Your son's an only child, right?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.560
Huh? Yeah.

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:07.020
Sometimes I wonder stupid things, 
like why I had to be the older brother...

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:13.790
Having to stay ahead of him just because 
I was born first is actually pretty hard.

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:16.070
It's not like there are save points.

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:20.720
I heard Toya-kun started playing 
badminton because he looked up to you.

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:27.040
Whenever I turn around, he's looking 
back at me with glittering eyes,

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:30.250
even though I'm just Villager A.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.720
You're amazing, Bro!

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:41.260
I'm not actually that attached to singles.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:49.870
I just didn't want to disappoint Toya 
as his brother and partner, so I ran.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.320
It's freakin' unbelievable!

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:57.530
Why do I feel like I've been rejected?!

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.560
Just go home already.

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:01.070
I can't go home!

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.960
I don't wanna see his stupid face!

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:05.290
Calm down.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:10.000
Maybe he actually hates me.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.910
That's not true. You're brothers.

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.330
You're an only child! 
You don't know what it's like!

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:16.470
I sure don't!

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:21.180
Where's Tatsuru-san, anyway? I wanted 
to bitch to him about sibling crap.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.920
Now that you mention it, 
it <i>has </i>been quiet recently.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:26.970
He's out on a Friday night? Damn normie!

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:29.380
Mister, could I get another?

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:31.500
This ain't an izakaya!

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.650
Could you practice with me after this?

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:39.890
Oh, sorry. I've got something to do.

00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:42.240
Didn't you say the same thing last week?

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:46.410
Did I? In any case, see you next week.

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:51.420
It must be spring.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.420
What? It's summer right now.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.380
I'm talking about Tatsu-san.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.700
He's been disappearing a lot lately.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:01.300
It must be because he got a girlfriend.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:04.040
There's no way.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:10.580
All right. As the Walking Speaker, 
I swear I'll get to the bottom of this.

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:12.890
There is always one truth!

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:17.610
Try again.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.520
What?! Why?!

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:20.970
...Sir.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.600
I thought I warned you

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:26.460
to avoid designs that would cause confusion 
when you submitted your request.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:32.980
<b>Product Name (Temp)</b>

00:11:26.770 --> 00:11:30.120
It's likely this design would 
make consumers think there's

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.900
shredded green onion in the ginger ale.

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:36.170
Th-The designer just took 
things a little too far.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.680
But it won't sell without this much impact.

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.830
There's no point in selling the drink
 if it causes problems later.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.600
Why haven't you come home?

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.330
You don't want to see my face, do you?

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:54.810
In any case, please resubmit your 
design first thing tomorrow.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:56.840
Fine.

00:11:58.350 --> 00:12:00.870
It's unusual for Toya to miss practice.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:03.820
Yeah, apparently he's having some problems.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:04.780
Huh?

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:16.110
Why is he ignoring my calls and messages?

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.390
It's my senior.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:24.090
I can't get in touch with the designer.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:27.910
<i>He's famous for refusing to do redesigns.</i>

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:31.240
<i>That's why I told you to make your 
request as detailed as possible.</i>

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.100
Sorry, sir.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:40.030
<b>Green Onion Ginger Ale Design (Ver. 1)</b>

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:40.030
<b>Product Name (Temp)</b>

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:39.100
This is the first time I've been 
put in charge of a job, too.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.570
No, it's not over yet!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.780
I'll hit up a bunch of other designers.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:52.870
Sorry for springing a sudden request on you.

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:55.310
I hope you'll work with us 
again in the future.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.980
Another no...

