00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:02.210
Toya?

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.320
Mikoto?

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:06.930
Are you working overtime? 
If there's anything I can do to help...

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:11.060
It's okay. This is my job.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:13.770
I don't need your help.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.040
Go on and head home.

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:21.440
He's pushing himself too hard...

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:26.980
Are you working overtime?

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:28.000
Yeah.

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:35.180
The QA department is on a different floor...

